{"results":[{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6O-NOTCeiaQ","title":"Rustomjee Summit Borivali Mumbai | Luxury Project in Borivali By Rustomjee | Houssed","raw_content":"# Rustomjee Summit Borivali Mumbai | Luxury Project in Borivali By Rustomjee | Houssed\n## Houssed\n102000 subscribers\n18 likes\n\n### Description\n5245 views\nPosted: 25 Feb 2023\nCheck Out Our Exclusive Walkthrough Video of Rustomjee Summit Borivali East Mumbai By Rustomjee Situated in the Prime Location of Borivali East Mumbai\n\nConfiguration:2, 2.5, 3 BHK\nCarpet Area: 710 - 1130 Sq ft\nRera Possession: December 2023\nNumber of Floors:14 Floors\nTotal Area:0.27 Acres\nPrice Range :₹ 2.6 Cr - 4 Cr\n\nKey Features of Rustomjee Summit\n\nSun-Lit Apartments.\nLandscape Concourse.\nWell-Equipped Clubhouse.\nDesigner Homes.\nAstounding Building Elevation.\nIn-Built Social Arenas.\n\nDevelopers Boman Irani and his group have put the best of their architectural designs into laying out the Rustomjee Summit project. Giving convenient connectivity to the regularly needed ways of life such as Western Express Highway, S.V. Road, Link Road, Rustomjee International School, Thakur School, Don Bosco School, Ryan International School, L. N. College, Crystal Hospital, etc.\n\nRustomjee is crafted to give its residents the ultimate luxury living experience, with a variety of modern amenities, including a multiplay court, gymnasium, multi-function room, swimming pool, indoor games room, kids' play area, and landscaped garden.\n\nIt's a home beyond your dreams fused with extravagant luxuries and clubbed with the comforts you can think of. You can experience a top-notch standard of living while residing at Rustomjee Summit. Give access to a dreamy life to your family with Rustomjee.\n\nKnow More and Request a Tour Now:\nhttps://www.houssed.com/homes/mumbai/rustomjee/rustomjee-summit-1016 \n\nYou Can also Find us at:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/houssedindia\nhttps://twitter.com/Houssedindia\nhttps://www.instagram.com/houssedindia/\n\nTo Know More and Request a Tour Call Now at 70300 66666  and Kindly Visit Our Website www.houssed.com\n\n#mumbaiflats #realestatemumbai #propertyforsalemumbai  #luxuryhomesindia #flatinmumbai  #realestate #realtor #realestateagent #homeinmumbai #property #investment #forsale #realtorlife #househunting #dreamhomeinmumbai #luxuryhomemumbai #interiordesign #luxuryrealestate #newhome #architecture #house #homesweethome  #realestateinvesting #luxuryhomes #realestatelife #business #design #realestateinvestor #realty #sold #mortgage #broker #homesforsale #justlisted #luxurylifestylemumbai #propertiesinmumbai  #realtors #homes #firsttimehomebuyer #homeforsale #construction #lifestyle #homedecor  #listing #invest #investing #realestatebroker #newlisting #investmentproperty #homebuyers #investor #propertymanagement  #realestatetips #openhouse #interior  #luxuryliving #homebuyingtips #mumbairealestate #mumbailuxuryflats #mumbai #houssed #houssed.com #houssedproperty\n#houssedindia\n\n2 comments\n### Transcript:\nforeign [Music] [Music] [Applause] [Music] [Music] [Applause] [Music] foreign [Music] [Music] [Music] [Music] thank you","images":[]},{"url":"https://realtypromoo.com/projects/rustomjee-summit","title":"Rustomjee Summit Borivali East Mumbai — Price & RERA","raw_content":"[Realty**Promoo**™](/)\n\n\n\n![Rustomjee Summit — 2 BHK, 3 BHK — Borivali West — Mumbai](/images/projects/rustomjee-summit.webp \"Rustomjee Summit\")\n\nPhoto by Rustomjee Summit via Google Places\n\n# Rustomjee Summit\n\nBy [Hukum Singh](/authors/hukum-singh)\n\nSenior Property Analyst (Freelancer) · 12 years experience\n\n[Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)](/developers/rustomjee-group-keystone-realtors-limited)\n\n[Borivali West](/mumbai/borivali-west)\n\n₹2.6 Cr - ₹4.5 Cr\n\n2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nDecember 2024\n\nReady to Move\n\nProject Scorecard by RealtyPromoo\n\n3.7 / 5\n\n★★★★★  4.3\n\nConstruction Quality\n\n★★★★★  3.4\n\n★★★⯨★  3.8\n\nValue for Money\n\n★★★⯨★  3.5\n\nBuilder Reputation\n\n★★★⯨★  3.6\n\n## About Rustomjee Summit\n\nSet this one against the typical [Mumbai](/cities/mumbai) suburban launch and the numbers look almost modest: a single tower on roughly 0.27 acres (1,111 sq.m as filed with MahaRERA), 240 units, 2 and 3 BHK homes only. There is no township scale here, no multi-phase master plan — this is a standalone redevelopment tower in [Rajendra Nagar](/hyderabad/rajendra-nagar), Borivali East, built by Rustomjee (Keystone Realtors Limited) on a plot where the original occupants were relocated to the adjoining Rustomjee Pinnacle building. What distinguishes it locally is a rooftop infinity pool and stargazing deck — brokers and the developer both describe it as the only project in this stretch of Borivali East with a pool on the roof rather than at podium level. Floor counts vary by source, from 37 to a MahaRERA-sanctioned 44 — a discrepancy typical of redevelopment projects where FSI gets revised mid-construction.\n\n## Key Highlights\n\n* Single tower, MahaRERA-sanctioned for 44 floors (marketed variously as 37-42 storeys across listing portals), with 240 units total\n* Project footprint of just 0.27 acres — among the smallest RERA-registered towers in Borivali East, meaning limited ground-level open space\n* Carpet areas run 715 to roughly 1,220 sq.ft. across 2 BHK and 3 BHK configurations\n* Originally filed with MahaRERA on 31 July 2017, with a proposed possession of December 2021 — later extended to December 2024\n* Rooftop infinity pool and stargazing deck, pitched by the developer as unique to this micro-market\n* 800m from Western Express Highway, roughly 1.1 km from Borivali Railway Station\n* Median resale/primary asking price around ₹32,600/sq.ft as tracked across marketplace listings, with some units quoted as high as ₹37,000/sq.ft\n* Developer track record spans over 10 million sq.ft delivered since 1996, including Rustomjee Pinnacle directly across the road\n\n## Location Advantages\n\nBorivali East sits at the far northern edge of Mumbai's western suburbs, and Rajendra Nagar specifically benefits from being wedged between the Western Express Highway and the Borivali railway corridor — both within a kilometre. That's the case for it. The case against: this is one of the busier, more congested pockets of Borivali, and buyer reviews flag noise and traffic as a genuine irritant rather than a minor footnote. There's no metro station within comfortable walking distance today, though Metro Line 7's extension is expected to eventually improve east-west connectivity. Sanjay Gandhi National Park lies close by, which is a genuine amenity for a suburb this dense — few pockets of Mumbai offer a national park boundary as a neighbour. Judge this location on the same axis you'd apply to any transit-adjacent Mumbai suburb: strong on connectivity, weak on breathing room.\n\n## What's Nearby — Schools, Hospitals, Malls\n\n| Category | Name | Distance | Drive Time |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| School | Rustomjee International School | ~1.5 km | 5-7 mins |\n| School | Don Bosco School, Borivali | ~2 km | 7-8 mins |\n| School | St. John's High School | ~2 km | 7-8 mins |\n| College | L.N. College | ~1.5 km | 5-6 mins |\n| Hospital | Crystal Hospital | ~1 km | 4-5 mins |\n| Hospital | Dhanashri Hospital | ~1.5 km | 5-6 mins |\n| Hospital | Apex Multispeciality Hospital | ~2 km | 7-8 mins |\n| Mall | Raghuleela Mall | ~2.5 km | 10-12 mins |\n| Mall | Growel's 101 | ~3 km | 12-15 mins |\n| Mall | Inorbit Mall, Malad | ~5 km | 15-20 mins |\n| Transit | Borivali Railway Station | 1.1 km | 4-5 mins |\n\n## Amenities\n\nFor a 0.27-acre single-tower footprint, the amenity list runs surprisingly deep, though it's worth noting most of it is stacked vertically rather than spread across grounds — a trade-off inherent to compact redevelopment plots.\n\n* **Fitness & Sports:** Gymnasium, jogging/cycling track, multipurpose sports court (badminton and similar), yoga area\n* **Water:** Rooftop swimming pool (the marketed differentiator), separate kids' pool\n* **Kids:** Kids' play area / sand pit\n* **Social:** Multipurpose banquet hall, library and business centre, landscaped/sky gardens, indoor games room\n* **Security:** 24x7 CCTV surveillance, intercom facility, panic-button connectivity to ground-floor security, video door phone in each unit\n\n## Price & Configuration\n\n| Type | Carpet Area (sq.ft.) | Price (₹) | Price per Sq.ft. |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 715 - 889 | ₹2.0 Cr - ₹2.9 Cr | ~₹28,000 - ₹32,600 |\n| 3 BHK | 998 - 1,220 | ₹2.79 Cr - ₹4.5 Cr | ~₹28,000 - ₹37,000 |\n\nPricing is quoted \"all-inclusive\" by some channel partners and carpet-area-only by others, so the spread across portals is wide — the median tracked across marketplace listings sits near ₹32,600/sq.ft, with a handful of resale listings pushing past ₹37,000/sq.ft. Payment structures reported include Construction Linked Plans; confirm the exact schedule at the sales office since this is now a ready-to-move inventory and CLP terms may have shifted to near-full payment on booking.\n\n**⚠️ Price Disclaimer:** Prices shown are indicative and based on RealtyPromoo research. Actual cost may vary based on floor rise, PLC (Preferential Location Charge), parking, GST, registration and developer-specific charges. **Contact us for the latest verified cost sheet.**\n\n## Construction Progress\n\nMahaRERA records show Rustomjee Summit (registration P51800003590) was originally filed on 31 July 2017 with a proposed possession of 31 December 2021. That date was extended to 30 December 2024. Multiple 2025-dated broker listings now describe the project as Ready to Move and effectively sold out. That said, at least one buyer complaint dated March 2025 describes the building receiving an Occupancy Certificate while individual flats were still pending handover — worth verifying directly with the developer if you're buying resale or late-stage inventory, rather than assuming OC-for-building automatically means OC-for-your-unit.\n\n## Investment Analysis\n\n* At a median ₹32,600/sq.ft, Rustomjee Summit prices in line with — slightly above — the broader Borivali East redevelopment segment, where comparable towers typically trade in the ₹28,000-33,000/sq.ft band\n* Being ready-to-move removes construction-timeline risk, which is the single biggest variable for any Mumbai suburban buyer weighing under-construction discounts against possession certainty\n* Rental demand in Borivali East is steady, driven by proximity to the Western Railway corridor; expect gross rental yields in the 2.5-3% range typical of ready Mumbai suburban stock, rather than anything higher\n* Resale liquidity should be reasonable given the location, though the compact 0.27-acre plot and single-tower format cap the ceiling compared to larger integrated projects nearby\n* Competing supply in the immediate vicinity — [Oberoi Sky City](/projects/oberoi-sky-city), Chandak Nishchay, and Sunteck Signia High, all in Borivali East — offers a useful price benchmark; buyers should compare per-sq.ft rates and amenity depth across all three before committing\n\n## Pros and Cons\n\n* Ready-to-move status removes construction and delivery-timeline risk entirely\n* Rooftop infinity pool is a genuine differentiator in a micro-market where most comparable towers stop at podium-level amenities\n* Strong physical connectivity — Western Express Highway within 800m, Borivali station within 1.1 km\n* Developer track record spans nearly three decades and over 10 million sq.ft delivered across Mumbai\n* MahaRERA registration is verifiable and consistent across every independent listing source checked\n\n* The project ran roughly three years past its original RERA-committed possession date (Dec 2021 to Dec 2024) — a material delay by any standard\n* At least one documented buyer complaint describes unresolved possession and post-sale communication issues even after building-level OC was reportedly granted\n* The 0.27-acre plot is compact — there's limited open ground space compared to newer integrated Borivali East launches with larger campuses\n* No metro station within comfortable walking distance yet; area traffic and noise are cited repeatedly in buyer reviews\n\n## Who Should Buy This\n\nIdeal for: end-user families who prioritise immediate possession over new-launch pricing, professionals commuting along the Western Railway or Western Express Highway corridor, and buyers specifically drawn to the rooftop-pool positioning that few comparable towers in this pocket of Borivali East can match. Not ideal for: buyers seeking large open green campuses, or anyone who's read the post-possession service complaints and wants zero ambiguity on handover timelines before signing — in that case, insist on unit-specific OC documentation, not just building-level OC, before final payment.\n\n## Site Visit Videos\n\n## FAQ — Frequently Asked Questions\n\n**Q: Is Rustomjee Summit RERA registered?**\n\nA: Yes. The project is registered under MahaRERA number P51800003590, filed originally on 31 July 2017 and verifiable directly on the MahaRERA portal.\n\n**Q: What is the possession date for Rustomjee Summit?**\n\nA: The originally proposed possession was December 2021; MahaRERA records show this was later extended to December 2024. Multiple current listings describe the project as Ready to Move.\n\n**Q: What is the price range at Rustomjee Summit?**\n\nA: 2 BHK units are priced roughly ₹2.0 Cr to ₹2.9 Cr, and 3 BHK units roughly ₹2.79 Cr to ₹4.5 Cr, translating to a median of about ₹32,600 per sq.ft across tracked listings.\n\n**Q: Is the builder reliable?**\n\nA: Rustomjee has delivered over 10 million sq.ft across Mumbai since 1996 and is generally regarded as an established name. That said, this specific project saw a roughly three-year possession delay and at least one documented post-possession complaint — weigh the brand's broader record against this project's specific track record.\n\n**Q: What is the nearest metro or rail station?**\n\nA: Borivali Railway Station on the Western Line is about 1.1 km away. There is no operational metro station within immediate walking distance currently, though the Metro Line 7 extension is planned for the wider area.\n\n**Q: Is Rustomjee Summit good for investment?**\n\nA: It prices in line with, or slightly above, comparable redevelopment towers in Borivali East. Ready-to-move status removes construction risk, but the compact single-tower format and limited open space cap upside compared to larger integrated developments nearby — treat it as a location-and-possession play rather than an appreciation play.\n\n**Q: How many units does the project have?**\n\nA: 240 units in total, spread across a single tower with only 2 BHK and 3 BHK configurations.\n\n**Q: What amenities make Rustomjee Summit different from nearby projects?**\n\nA: Its rooftop infinity pool and stargazing deck are marketed as unique to this specific stretch of Borivali East, distinguishing it from towers with podium-level pools only.\n\n### Questions & Answers (0)\n\nPopular:\n\nPreparing your answer…\n\n🔒 Unlock your full answer\n\nWe’ll show it here and send a copy to your WhatsApp.\n\n### Terms & Conditions — Q&A\n\nBy submitting a question on RealtyPromoo, you agree to these terms:\n\n#### 1. Content Policy\n\n* Your question must be a genuine real estate query.\n* No abusive, defamatory, or promotional content.\n* No personal contact info, broker referrals, or spam.\n* Questions are reviewed by AI and may be edited for clarity, grammar, or politeness before publication.\n\n#### 2. Publication\n\n* Your first name + last initial (e.g., \"Rahul S.\") will be displayed publicly with the answer.\n* Your full name, phone number, and email are **never** displayed publicly.\n* Once published, your question and answer become part of RealtyPromoo's content.\n\n#### 3. Phone & Email\n\n* Your phone number is required so our team can share the answer with you on WhatsApp and assist with your query.\n* Your phone number and email are stored securely and may be used by RealtyPromoo or its sales team to contact you regarding your query or related properties.\n\n#### 4. Answer Accuracy\n\n* Answers are generated by AI based on publicly available information and the page context.\n* Answers are informational only — not financial, legal, or investment advice.\n* Always verify pricing, RERA status, and possession dates with the developer before any transaction.\n* RealtyPromoo is not liable for decisions made based on AI-generated answers.\n\n#### 5. Pre-RERA / Pre-Launch Projects\n\n* Some listed projects are pre-RERA / pre-launch. These listings are **informational only**.\n* No booking, sale, or agreement is permitted before RERA registration.\n* \"Express Your Interest\" forms collect contact details for future communication, not advance bookings.\n\n#### 6. Moderation\n\n* RealtyPromoo reserves the right to delete, edit, or refuse to publish any question or answer.\n\n#### 7. Privacy\n\n* Your data is handled per our [Privacy Policy](/privacy-policy).\n\n#### 8. Jurisdiction\n\n* These terms are governed by the laws of India.\n* Disputes are subject to the courts of Noida, Uttar Pradesh.\n\nBe the first to ask a question. Get an answer in seconds.\n\n### Questions & Answers\n\nIs this project worth it? Not sure about price or possession? Have a doubt? Get an instant answer\n\nAsk now\n\nHave a question?\n\nStill have doubts about Rustomjee Summit?\n\nAsk anything — price, possession, RERA, location. Answer in seconds.\n\ne.g. Is the possession date realistic? Is it worth the price?\n\nNo thanks\n\nYour answer\n\nA copy is on its way to your WhatsApp.\n\n**How this page was written**\n\nThis page was drafted by **Hukum Singh**, Senior Property Analyst (Freelancer) after an on-site visit, with research support from artificial intelligence. AI assisted in compiling information from public sources, and th