ee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nPali Hill, Bandra West, Mumbai\n\n₹16.19 Cr - ₹82.5 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 4 BHK, 5 BHK, Penthouse\n\nRERA Possession January 2026\n\n[![Rustomjee Prive Bandra East Mumbai](/images/projects/rustomjee-prive-bandra-east-mumbai.webp) Under Construction](/projects/rustomjee-prive-bandra-east-mumbai) \n\n### [Rustomjee Prive Bandra East Mumbai](/projects/rustomjee-prive-bandra-east-mumbai)\n\nby Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nKala Nagar, BKC Annexe, Bandra East, Mumbai\n\n₹5.40 Cr - ₹8.36 Cr\n\n3 BHK\n\nRERA Possession November 2029\n\n[![Rustomjee Bandra West Mumbai Project](/images/projects/rustomjee-bandra-west-mumbai-project.webp) Under Construction](/projects/rustomjee-bandra-west-mumbai-project) \n\n### [Rustomjee Bandra West Mumbai Project](/projects/rustomjee-bandra-west-mumbai-project)\n\nby Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nMount Mary, Bandra West, Mumbai\n\n₹38.12 Cr - ₹65.32 Cr\n\n4 BHK, 5 BHK, 6 BHK\n\nRERA Possession December 2030\n\n[![Rustomjee Balmoral Chembur Mumbai](/images/projects/rustomjee-balmoral-chembur-mumbai.webp) Under Construction](/projects/rustomjee-balmoral-chembur-mumbai) \n\n### [Rustomjee Balmoral Chembur Mumbai](/projects/rustomjee-balmoral-chembur-mumbai)\n\nby Rustomjee Group (keystone Realtors Limited)\n\nChembur (basant Park, Near Bombay Presidency Golf Club), Mumbai\n\n₹7.58 Cr - ₹11.88 Cr\n\n3 BHK, 3.5 BHK (3+Study), 4 BHK, 5 BHK\n\nRERA Possession April 2030\n\n[![Lodha Altus Borivali West Mumbai](/images/projects/lodha-altus-borivali-west-mumbai.webp) Under Construction](/projects/lodha-altus-borivali-west-mumbai) \n\n### [Lodha Altus Borivali West Mumbai](/projects/lodha-altus-borivali-west-mumbai)\n\nby Lodha Group\n\nBorivali West, Mumbai\n\n₹2.85 Cr - ₹6.5 Cr\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nRERA Possession December 2028\n\n[![Rustomjee Andheri East Redevelopment Mumbai Project](/images/projects/rustomjee-andheri-east-redevelopment-mumbai-project.webp) Upcoming](/projects/