mumbai/borivali-east/villas-lpt7l1433)\n  + [Ready to Move Apartments in Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/ready-to-move-lps4l1433)\n  + [Plots for Sale In Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/mumbai/borivali-east/plots-lpt6l1433)\n/* Rustomjee Summit\n\n## Rustomjee Summit\n\n[![location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/navigate-outline.svg)Borivali East](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-borivali-east-mumbai-l1433) [![Developer](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/business-outline.svg) By: Rustomjee Constructions](https://www.addressofchoice.com/property-in-rustomjee-constructions-d5187)\n\n![Location](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/icons/location-outline.svg)Carter Rd, Dattapada, Borivali East, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400066.\n\n[![Google](https://www.google.com/favicon.ico) Add As A Preferred  \nSource On Google](https://www.google.com/preferences/source?q=Addressofchoice.com)\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\nPrice Range Starting from\n\n###### 2.09 Cr to 3.61 Cr\\*\n\n![Rustomjee Summit](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/53830/1610795275_e1.jpeg \"Rustomjee Summit\")\n\n# Rustomjee Summit in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price | Floor Plan | Photos | Master Plan | Brochure | Amenities | Location\n\n![Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-floor-plan.jpg \"Floor Plan\")\n\n![Site Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/gallery-site-plan.jpg \"Site Plan\")\n\n![Rustomjee Summit](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/elevation/53830/1610795275_e1.jpeg \"Rustomjee Summit\")\n\n[![Save](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/heart-outline.svg)Save](#) [![Review](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/chatbox-outline.svg) Post A Review](#rating)\n\n#### Are you interested in property?\n\nGet attractive benefits with addressofchoice.com\n\n* [Highlights](#review)\n* [Overview](#overview)\n* [Units](#price_listWarpper)\n* [Specifications](#specifications)\n* [Locality & Price Trends](#locality)\n* [Related Projects](#Projects)\n* [Developers](#Developers)\n* [Review & Ratings](#rating)\n* [FAQs](#faqs)\n\n2 ,3 BHK Residential Property \n\nEMI Start at ₹\n\nStatus: **Ready to Move**\n\n[![call](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/call-outline.svg) CONTACT NOW](javascript:void(0)) [![home](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/conversation.svg) FAQ's](#faq_Property)\n\n* Apartment Sizes Ranges in Between 998 sqft - 1129 sqft.\n* Total Units & Towers: 240 Units & Towers\n* Total Project Area: Acres\n* Possession: June, 2023\n* Rera: P51800003590\n\n## About\n\nRustomjee Summit is a remarkable Residential project located in the well-connected Borivali East locality of Mumbai. Spanning Details Available Upon Request, the project features 240 Units in Details Available Upon Request, offering a mix of 2 BHK+2T, to 3 BHK+3T Apartments ranging from 998 sqft to 1129 sqft. The address for the project is carter rd, dattapada, borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra 400066..\n\n**Available Property Sizes**\n\nThe Apartments at Rustomjee Summit are available in a variety of sizes. The 2 BHK+2T units start at 998 sqft. The larger 3 BHK+3T Apartments go up to 1129 sqft, providing ample space for families of all sizes.\n\n**Price Range**\n\nThe prices for the Apartments at Rustomjee Summit are designed to be accessible, with 2 BHK+2T units priced from 2.09 Cr and 3 BHK+3T Apartments from 3.61 Cr, depending on the size and configuration.\n\n**Developer Information**\n\nThe project is being developed by Rustomjee Constructions, known for its commitment to quality and timely delivery. RERA registration number for the project is P51800003590 Units. Possession is expected to begin in 2023-06-14, ensuring that the property is well on track for future homeowners.\n\n**Amenities and Features**\n\nRustomjee Summit is designed to offer a blend of luxury and convenience. Key sports amenities include a Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym. For relaxation, the development offers a Lifts, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden. The security features include Fire Alarm for enhanced safety.\n\n**Construction and Specifications**\n\nThe project is constructed using premium materials such as vitrified tiles for flooring, granite countertops in the kitchens, and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\n**Key Information**\n\n* Total Area: Details Available Upon Request\n* Units & Towers: 240 Units, Details Available Upon Request\n* Sizes: 998 sqft to 1129 sqft\n* Project Address: carter rd, dattapada, borivali east, mumbai, maharashtra 400066.\n* Type: Residential Apartments\n* Developer: Rustomjee Constructions\n* RERA Registration No.: P51800003590 Units\n* Possession Start: 2023-06-14\n* Construction Quality: Premium materials, vitrified tiles, granite countertops\n* Security: Fire Alarm\n* Sports Facilities: Sports Facility, Kids Play Area, Swimming Pool, Gym\n* Convenience Amenities: Lifts, Maintenance Staff, Multipurpose Hall, Club house, Garden\n\n**Location Benefits**\n\nRustomjee Summit benefits from its location in Borivali East, offering great connectivity to schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and public transport systems. This makes it an ideal place to live, especially for families.\n\n**Developer and Project Details**\n\nPossession at Rustomjee Summit will begin in 2023-06-14, and the project is RERA registered under P51800003590 Units. Developed by Rustomjee Constructions, this project promises a reliable investment for prospective homeowners.\n\n### Sports Amenities\n\n* ![Sports Facility](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804694_sport-facility.svg) Sports Facility\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804595_kids-play-area.svg) Kids Play Area\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804565_swimming-pool.svg) Swimming Pool\n* ![Gym](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804743_gym.svg) Gym\n\n### Convenience Amenities\n\n* ![Lifts](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804644_lift.svg) Lifts\n* ![Maintenance Staff](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804773_maintenance-staff.svg) Maintenance Staff\n* ![Multipurpose Hall](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804708_multipurpose-hall.svg) Multipurpose Hall\n* ![Club house](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804551_club-house.svg) Club house\n* ![garden](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804627_garden.svg) Garden\n\n### Safety Amenities\n\n* ![Fire Alarm](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/amenities/1528804761_fire-alarm.svg) Fire Alarm\n\n## Floor Plans of Rustomjee Summit\n\n![Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan 715 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (715 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan 747 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (747 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/images/no-image.jpg \"Rustomjee Summit Floor Plan 889 sqft\")\n\n2 BHK (889 Sq. Ft.)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\nLoan Amount (80% of Total Cost) : 1.67 Cr\n\n## Rental Options Available!\n\nExplore rental flats in Godrej E-City\n\n [Check Rental Listings →](https://rental.addressofchoice.com/property-for-rent-in-rustomjee-summit-borivali-east-mumbai-prop53830)\n\n## Bank Offers for Rustomjee Summit\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958784_sbi.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958779_icici.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958773_hdfc.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958767_axis.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958761_canara.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958377_indiabulls.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958423_pnb.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528958411_tata.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528957944_reliance_capital.png \" \")\n\n![](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/bank/1528956975_dhfl.png \" \")\n\n![imageBackh](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets_new/images/imageBackh.png)\n\n## Hi! I'm here to answer all your queries.\n\n**Vaishali Vasant Tiwari**  \n Relationship Manager\n\n[Chat with us](https://wa.me/8800117588?text=I'm%20interested%20in%20Rustomjee Summit)\n\n## Rustomjee Summit Specifications\n\n![Structure](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor-plans2.svg)\n\nStructure\n\nSeismic Zone 2 compliant structure and Solid Block Masonry.\n\n![Ground Water](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor-plans2.svg)\n\nGround Water\n\nSweet Water with 100 Feet down from Ground Level.\n\n![Flooring](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/floor.svg)\n\nFlooring\n\nVitrified tiles in drawing/dining/bedrooms and kitchen.\n\n![Electrical & Power Backup](https://www.addressofchoice.com/aoc_assets/new/images/icons/power_back_up-grey.svg)\n\nElectrical & Power Backup\n\nCopper wiring in concealed PVC conduits Sufficient light and power points.\n\n![Kitchen](h