mjee Summit](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3131/photo-22886.jpeg)\n\n![Rustomjee Summit](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3131/photo-22887.jpeg)\n\n![Rustomjee Summit](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3131/photo-22888.jpeg)\n\nby Rustomjee Builders\n\n# Rustomjee Summit\n\nDattapada , Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3 BHK\n\nSize 728 Sq.ft To 1220 Sq.ft Carpet Area\n\nPrice ₹1.83 Cr Onwards\n\nCall Now +919769025551\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow3131\n\nPossession Status Possesssion Expected Around December 2021\n\nRERA P51800003590  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## RUSTOMJEE SUMMIT\n\n**Rustomjee Summit** Mumbai is an on-going housing project launched by Rustomjee Developers at Borivali East in Mumbai. The project is designed in an entire land of 0.28 Acre with an choice of 2 BHK & 3 BHK flats with starting area from 728 Sq.ft To 1220 Sq.ft Carpet Area. at very aggressive and inex\n\npensive cost. It is well designed and is designed with all modern features.\n\n**Advantage of Location:**\n\nBorivali East is a suburb of Mumbai and is placed in the north-western side of the city. Separated by the Western Line, Borivali East and Borivali West are two areas in the western suburb. The main attraction of Borivali West is the Sanjay Gandhi Park. Borivali is also a station on the Suburban Railway Network. To improve connection, a monorail line and a metro in the area have also been suggested. Gokhale College, ISMT Business School, St. Rocks College of Commerce and Science, Institute of Management Studies and search and a Memorial Foundation College are some of the popular colleges in the locality.\n\nRustomjee builders founded in 1996. it is their constant endeavour to transform the city with every building. They push us to find modern solutions, it is not so much to save expenses, as it is to save our atmosphere. As a designer, they have always believed that form follows operate. They recognize that buying a home is more than just a deal, it is the understanding of an important dream. By identifying possible, giving everybody equal chance and nurturing talent, they are supporting to create the next age group of management. In the last five years alone, Rustomjee Builders have provided 8 million square feet of the structure area, with a special concentrate on the Mumbai Metropolitan Region.\n\n**For more details you may please contact us.**\n\nType, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 728 Sq.ft Carpet | 1.83 CR |\n| 2 BHK | 760 Sq.ft Carpet | 1.91 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 1138 Sq.ft Carpet | 2.86 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 1173 Sq.ft Carpet | 2.95 CR |\n| 3 BHK | 1220 Sq.ft Carpet | 3.07 CR |\n\n**Note:** Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. **\\*Rates are indicative.**\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n**Landscape :**   \n\\* Landscaped Garden   \n  \n**Indoor Games :**   \n\\* Indoor Games   \n  \n**Fitness :**   \n\\* Swimming Pool   \n\\* Gymnasium   \n  \n**Outdoor Games :**   \n\\* Play Area   \n\\* Tennis Court   \n\\* Badminton Court   \n\\* Basket Ball Court   \n  \n**Network & Connectivity :**   \n\\* Intercom   \n\\* Wifi   \n  \n**Green Living :**   \n\\* Rain Water Harvesting   \n  \n**Recreation :**   \n\\* Club House   \n\\* Temple   \n  \n**Convenience :**   \n\\* Library   \n\\* Maintenance Staff   \n\\* 24Hr Backup Electricity   \n  \n**Health Facilities :**   \n\\* Health Facilities   \n  \n**Eateries :**   \n\\* Cafeteria   \n  \n**Safety & Security :**   \n\\* Gated community   \n\\* Security   \n  \n**Infrastructure :**   \n\\* Pucca Road\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n**STRUCTURE:**  \n\\* Earthquake resistance structure  \n  \n**LOBBY:**  \n\\* Grand designer entrance lobby provided  \n  \n**POWER BACK-UP:**  \n\\* 100% power back up for common area essential services  \n  \n**MODULAR KITCHEN:**  \n\\* Granite platform with stainless steel sink in kitchen  \n  \n**FITTINGS:**  \n\\* Reflective glass MPVC sliding windows  \n\\* Kohler or equivalent make bathroom Sanitary ware  \n  \n**FLOORING:**  \n\\* Imported marble flooring in entire unit  \n  \n**ELECTRICALS:**  \n\\* Split AC provision\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nRERA Details\n\n## RERA QR Code\n\n![](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/3131/qra_1945.png)\n\n**RERA No:** P51800003590\n\n**Developer:** Rustomjee Builders\n\n**Project:** Rustomjee Summit\n\n[Verify on MahaRERA Website →](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/)\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Dattapada , Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Dattapada , Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Dattapada Road, Rajendra Nagar & Dattapada\n\nFAQ\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions about RUSTOMJEE SUMMIT\n\nWhere is Rustomjee Summit Exactly located?\n\nRustomjee Summit is located at Dattapada , .\n\nIs Rustomjee Summit Rera Registered?\n\nYes, It is RERA Registered with Rera Number P51800003590. You can verify the details on the official RERA website.\n\nWhat are unit options available in Rustomjee Summit?\n\nRustomjee Summit offers 2 BHK & 3 BHK.\n\nWhat is the starting price of Flats in Rustomjee Summit?\n\nThe starting price of Flats at Rustomjee Summit is 1.83 Cr Onwards. Contact us for the latest pricing and offers.\n\nWhen is the Possession of Flats?\n\nThe expected possession date for Rustomjee Summit is Possesssion Expected Around December 2021.\n\nWhat are the nearest landmarks?\n\nKey landmarks near Rustomjee Summit include Rajendra nagar market, Akash China Point, Rajendra Nagar Post Office,The National Co-Op Bank ATM, Borivali Railway Station, LN College & Borivali Police Station.\n\nIs Rustomjee Summit, approved by Banks for Home Loans?\n\nYes, Rustomjee Summit is approved by leading banks and financial institutions for home loans. Contact us for assistance 